# Normalize all text files to LF in the repository, regardless of what a given
# contributor's OS/editor/git config writes to their working directory. Without
# this, Windows checkouts (e.g. GitHub Actions' windows-latest runner, which
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true) convert LF -> CRLF on checkout, and Prettier
# (which defaults to LF) then flags every one of those files as unformatted -
# `bun run format:check` fails in CI on line endings alone, with no actual
# content difference.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Windows-only files that genuinely want CRLF for that platform's tools.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Binary assets: never touch line endings, never diff as text.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.icns binary
*.woff2 binary
*.db binary
